|---|---:|
| PbWO₄ scheelite | 54.94% |
| PbO massicot | 11.30% |
| PbO litharge | 7.35% |
| monoclinic WO₃ | 8.71% |
| W₃O₈ | 6.34% |
| cubic PbO₂ | 2.81% |
| monoclinic Pb₂O₃ | 5.40% |
| tetragonal Pb₃O₄ | 3.16% |

Final statistics: Rwp 11.45%, Rp 8.00%, GOF 3.27. The GPX replayed successfully from its atomic models, and `fit.csv` matches the replayed profile.

